{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20419",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 7.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "doctor, this one's ready for you everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.35,
      "end_seconds": 13.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 19.06,
      "end_seconds": 25.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.29,
      "end_seconds": 32.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 32.74,
      "end_seconds": 40.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "We came because of pain going down the back of my left leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.36,
      "end_seconds": 44.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.54,
      "end_seconds": 49.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "it's been three weeks, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.25,
      "end_seconds": 60.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.66,
      "end_seconds": 75.16,
      "duration_seconds": 12.5,
      "text": "about a eight out of ten i get some relief from lying flat it happens a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.23,
      "end_seconds": 79.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "So, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.52,
      "end_seconds": 88.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get trouble sleeping because of the pain as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.07,
      "end_seconds": 95.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 95.36,
      "end_seconds": 101.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.62,
      "end_seconds": 105.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "later, thanks please go on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.35,
      "end_seconds": 144.87,
      "duration_seconds": 37.52,
      "text": "Ah, as for stiffness in the morning, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Actually, you know, as for stiffness in the morning, it sort of comes and goes. The trouble sleeping because of the pain? That's been for about three months. With trouble sleeping because of the pain, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.24,
      "end_seconds": 155.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Okay, have you had pain going down the back of your left leg before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.52,
      "end_seconds": 167.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "text": "Yes, um, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.44,
      "end_seconds": 173.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.88,
      "end_seconds": 187.9,
      "duration_seconds": 13.02,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.42,
      "end_seconds": 205.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.49,
      "end_seconds": 212.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease. Ah, uh, my cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.03,
      "end_seconds": 218.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.41,
      "end_seconds": 234.02,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to naproxen, but I don't remember what reaction I had. Um, I'm allergic to cat fur, I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.77,
      "end_seconds": 237.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.33,
      "end_seconds": 245.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I had two stents put in my heart three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.81,
      "end_seconds": 251.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.14,
      "end_seconds": 263.23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "It's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. Clopidogrel. I take it once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.73,
      "end_seconds": 267.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.19,
      "end_seconds": 274.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "75 milligrams. I take paracetamol, 1 gram, maybe, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.27,
      "end_seconds": 280.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay, have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.39,
      "end_seconds": 285.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.88,
      "end_seconds": 290.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Okay, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.11,
      "end_seconds": 299.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.69,
      "end_seconds": 302.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.66,
      "end_seconds": 311.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "So, I've got diabetes. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.57,
      "end_seconds": 314.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.54,
      "end_seconds": 317.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I've got heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.59,
      "end_seconds": 324.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Alright, high blood pressure and diabetes, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.21,
      "end_seconds": 342.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Any bladder problems, numbness between the legs or weakness in the foot at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.48,
      "end_seconds": 362.48,
      "duration_seconds": 18.0,
      "text": "No, no bladder problems, no numbness between the legs, no weakness in the foot. I did have lower back pain at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.02,
      "end_seconds": 368.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "right, any fever, weight loss or bowel problems at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.78,
      "end_seconds": 375.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Uh, no, no fever, weight loss or bowel problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.64,
      "end_seconds": 380.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.01,
      "end_seconds": 382.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 383.99,
      "end_seconds": 394.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.9, pulse is 71 beats a minute, pressure 125 over 75, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.96,
      "end_seconds": 396.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.21,
      "end_seconds": 403.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.96,
      "end_seconds": 406.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.14,
      "end_seconds": 427.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Straight leg raising on the left brings on the leg pain at about forty degrees, and the power and reflexes are normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.75,
      "end_seconds": 452.38,
      "duration_seconds": 21.63,
      "text": "all finished, thank you so, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say. Sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation is one possibility and a muscle strain another, and I'd rather not commit yet a narrowed spinal canal is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.3,
      "end_seconds": 458.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 459.48,
      "end_seconds": 474.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.12,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book an MRI of the lower back to look into sciatica."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 475.23,
      "end_seconds": 477.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 479.56,
      "end_seconds": 490.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'll want another look in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 496.96,
      "end_seconds": 499.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 504.58,
      "end_seconds": 510.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 510.99,
      "end_seconds": 518.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "So, um, I come back in four weeks. Is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 520.32,
      "end_seconds": 524.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 527.97,
      "end_seconds": 531.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Uh, thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}